{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ROVA is a Cosy Space-Rover Photography Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help a new space colony conduct research on large spherical planets, by documenting elements of alien worlds through photography.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ROVA is a game about discovery and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*<i>Please note that ROVA is very early into development and that we are a small team. This demo showcases the current pre-alpha state of the game and is subject to change. We intend to release updates to the demo as development continues, similar to Early Access titles.</i>*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Space photography (images save to your pc!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Large spherical planets to explore, with a range of biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A strong 3D line-art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Day/Night Cycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Colonists with day schedules you can follow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 'Observation/study mode' - enjoy a range of lofi songs whilst observing colonists perform their daily routines</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147020/extras/store_capsule_main_03.png?t=1745093159\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3147020?t=1745093159","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745093159","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147020/1b9fb070e801245435f092392e133553f4c01aa8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745093159","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.s